      en: ["Located on an island in the Congo River estuary near Soyo.", "Managed by Kwanda Lda, a joint venture including Sonangol.", "A central logistics hub for oil and gas activities in the Congo Basin.", "Provides specialized port facilities for offshore supply vessels (PSVs).", "Hosts workshops and warehouses for international oil service companies.", "Strategically vital due to its proximity to the Angola LNG plant."],
